     Sounds like gtty and stty are defined in sgtty.h, but the library 
the functions are in isn't being loaded. Does FreeBSD have libcompat? I 
just did a quick look around my OpenBSD box and found them living there 
(they're in /usr/src/lib/libcompat/4.1, if anyone's wondering), so doing

     gmake CFLAGS="-ansi" LDFLAGS="-lcompat"

could be the easiest solution...

